  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Summary:<br><br>Sunrise Beach Subdivision - Calypso Cottage<br><br><br><br>The Space:<br><br>Calypso Cottage is a beautiful three-story home nestled in the gated community of Sunrise Beach in Santa Rosa Beach. This 2,360-square-foot home is within walking distance of Gulf Place, a town center with plenty of shopping and dining venues. Enjoy time with your family in your private swimming pool or walk down to the beach! The living area and the primary bedroom both offer private balconies where you can sit back and enjoy gentle Gulf breezes from the nearby emerald waters of the Gulf of Mexico. The upgraded third-floor kitchen is well-equipped, so you can prep and serve meals at home.<br><br><br><br>The combined living and dining area offer Gulf views and create an ideal place for family gatherings with its large TV and dining table. All bedrooms are equipped with TVs. There is also a full-size washer/ dryer for your convenience. Right outside the den, you relax in your private pool, with plenty of outdoor seating and a grill for those who like to cook and dine alfresco.<br><br><br><br>Being in the community of Sunrise Beach means this home is a short bike ride away from all that the west end of 30A has to offer. A ride east will take you to Grayton State Park or the areas of Watercolor and Seaside, where The Truman Show was filmed. Grayton Beach State Park, which features the Underwater Museum of Art, is nine miles away. Deer Lake State Park is sixteen miles from the home, where you can observe nature and wildlife. <br><br><br><br>No matter what brings you to Calypso Cottage, this home, the scenery, the community, and an array of local attractions will make you realize you’ve been in paradise and keep you returning.<br><br><br><br><b>Things to Know</b><br><br>Neighborhood beach access is available down the boardwalk. <br><br>Home includes beach service of 4 chairs and 6 umbrellas. 8 other personal chairs are allowed to sit with the LDV setup at no expense. That will allow 12 people to sit there at no expense to any guests. They should all be positioned straight down from the neighborhood boardwalk with 'Calypso cottage' on the back of the chairs.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Three-story beach home with private pool, beach access, & bikes - golf nearby"
        }
      ],
